<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cash-Out Request Received</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #03930A;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #333333;
        }

        .amount-box {
            background-color: #f0faf0;
            border: 1px solid #03930A;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .amount-box .amount {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #03930A;
        }

        .details-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }

        .details-table td {
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555555;
        }

        .details-table td.label {
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 40%;
            color: #333333;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div
        style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">

        <div
            style="text-align: center; padding: 32px 0; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;">
            <img src="https://odatransportation.com/static/media/Odaa%20Transportation%20-%20Logo_Primary%20Logo.391dbf01f07d5f1b361d.png"
                alt="ODA Transportation Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>We've Received Your Cash-Out Request</h1>
            <p>Hello <%= fullName %>,</p>
            <p>Thanks for reaching out — we've received your request to cash out part of your wallet credit balance.
                Our team will review it and contact you shortly to arrange payment outside the app.</p>

            <div class="amount-box">
                <div>Amount Requested</div>
                <div class="amount">$<%= amountRequested.toFixed(2) %></div>
            </div>

            <table class="details-table">
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Requested On</td>
                    <td><%= requestedAt %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Remaining Wallet Balance</td>
                    <td>$<%= balanceRemaining.toFixed(2) %></td>
                </tr>
                <% if (payout) { %>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Payout Method</td>
                    <td><%= payout.label %></td>
                </tr>
                <% payout.rows.forEach(function(row) { %>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label"><%= row[0] %></td>
                    <td><%= row[1] %></td>
                </tr>
                <% }) %>
                <% } %>
                <% if (note) { %>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Your Note</td>
                    <td><%= note %></td>
                </tr>
                <% } %>
            </table>

            <% if (!payout) { %>
            <p style="background-color: #fff8ec; border: 1px solid #F59E0B; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 14px;">
                Tip: add a payout method (Zelle, Venmo, bank transfer, etc.) next time so we know exactly where to
                send your money — no follow-up call needed.
            </p>
            <% } %>

            <p>This request doesn't pay out automatically — someone from our team will reach out directly once it's
                been reviewed. You can check its status anytime from your account's Wallet section.</p>
            <p>Thank you,<br>ODA Transportation Team</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
